homelab-keepalived (0.1.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Float multiple VIPs, each on its own interface, via a new `vips:` list
    in vrrp.yml (one public IP per interface; all float together in the one
    VRRP instance so a single node owns them). Original single `vip:`/
    `vip_interface:` form still accepted. Optional `default_route_interface`
    pins the master-only default route (else the first vip's interface).
    apply-script paths are env-overridable for testing; added t/apply.t.

 -- Gardner <gardner@homelab>  Sun, 25 Oct 2026 16:13:15 -0500

